4. BookMyShow Cross-Browser and Device Testing

The following differences were observed while testing BookMyShow on Chrome and Edge using desktop and mobile views:

i) Navigation Menu

On desktop, the navigation menu is displayed horizontally.
On mobile, the menu becomes smaller and more compact.
Some options may be hidden inside a menu icon.

ii) Banners

On desktop, promotional banners fit properly on the screen.
On mobile, banners are resized or slightly cropped to fit the smaller screen.
Banner text may appear closer to the edges on mobile.

3) Buttons

On desktop, buttons are larger and have more space.
On mobile, buttons become smaller or may be arranged vertically.
Minor differences in button spacing and alignment may appear between Chrome and Edge.

Conclusion: No major rendering issue was found. Most of the changes were due to different screen sizes.



